IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TABLES.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 TBL.
   05 ENTRY-ROW OCCURS 10 TIMES ASCENDING KEY IS ROW-KEY INDEXED BY IX.
      10 ROW-KEY    PIC X(4).
      10 ROW-VAL    PIC 9(4) COMP.
01 VAR-TBL.
   05 CNT        PIC 99.
   05 ITEM       PIC X OCCURS 1 TO 20 TIMES DEPENDING ON CNT.
01 GRID.
   05 ROW-G OCCURS 3.
      10 CELL    PIC 9 OCCURS 3.
01 SUB1        PIC 99.
01 TEXT-BUF    PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
01 REDEF REDEFINES TEXT-BUF PIC X(10) OCCURS 2.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    SET IX TO 1
    SEARCH ENTRY-ROW
        AT END DISPLAY "not found"
        WHEN ROW-KEY (IX) = "ABCD" DISPLAY ROW-VAL (IX)
    END-SEARCH
    SEARCH ALL ENTRY-ROW
        WHEN ROW-KEY (IX) = "WXYZ" CONTINUE
    END-SEARCH
    MOVE 1 TO SUB1
    MOVE 5 TO CELL (SUB1 2)
    MOVE TEXT-BUF (1:5) TO TEXT-BUF (6:5)
    SET IX UP BY 1
    INITIALIZE GRID
    INITIALIZE TBL REPLACING NUMERIC DATA BY ZERO
    DISPLAY ROW-KEY OF ENTRY-ROW (IX)
    STOP RUN.
